---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use | Edubuzz" description="Terms and conditions for using Edubuzz — South Africa's job board." canonicalUrl={Astro.url.href}>
  <main class="content-page panel">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p>Last updated: May 2026</p>
    <p>By using Edubuzz.co.za, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>

    <h2>Eligibility</h2>
    <p>You must be at least 16 years old to use Edubuzz. By creating an account, you represent that you meet this requirement and that all information you provide is accurate.</p>

    <h2>Job seeker terms</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You are responsible for the accuracy of your CV and profile information</li>
      <li>You may apply to any public job listing on the platform</li>
      <li>Edubuzz does not guarantee employment or interview invitations</li>
      <li>We are not responsible for the content of employer job listings</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Employer terms</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>You must provide accurate company and job listing information</li>
      <li>Job listings must comply with South African labour laws, including the Employment Equity Act</li>
      <li>You may not post discriminatory, misleading, or fraudulent job listings</li>
      <li>Edubuzz reserves the right to remove any listing that violates these terms</li>
      <li>Premium listings and featured placements are subject to the pricing set at time of purchase</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Prohibited conduct</h2>
    <p>You may not: post false or misleading information, use automated means to scrape or access the platform, impersonate others, attempt to breach platform security, or use the platform for any illegal purpose.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The Edubuzz name, logo, and platform design are our intellectual property. Job listings and content submitted by users remain the property of the respective users, but you grant us a license to display it on the platform.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>Edubuzz is provided "as is" without warranties. We are not liable for any damages arising from use of the platform, including but not limited to: failed job applications, inaccurate listings, or service interruptions.</p>

    <h2>Changes to terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Any disputes shall be resolved in South African courts.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="/contact">edubuzz.co.za/contact</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .content-page { max-width: 760px; margin: 1.5rem auto; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
  h2 { margin: 20px 0 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a1a; }
  p, li { color: #444; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  ul { padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  a { color: #2d6a4f; }
</style>
